# Chess Lesson file
#+Title: Checkmate on promotions
#+Description: This lessons is to illustrate promotion checks and check mates
#+Author: Daniel Pedroche
#+Language: en
#+Avatar: teachers_danioche

#+StartingPosition: "8/k1P1q3/8/8/8/1KP5/8/8 w - - 0 1"

#+Begin_teacher

When the pawn gets to the last rank, it can turn into any other piece except a king.
You almost always want to promote to a queen, the most powerful piece.

#+End_teacher

#+Begin_tips

- A fun but rare exception—promoting into a royal knight fork.

#+End_tips

#+Begin_move_list

PGN: 1. c8=N+ *
Teacher: 👏🏻👏🏻👏🏻👏🏻 🎉🥳🎉🥳 That´s correct, you found the checkmate, this is called the Back rank (or Corridor) mate.


#+End_move_list

